My degree in Scandiavian Studies has given me: 
- An advanced level in Norwegian and Swedish, as well as intermediate level in Dutch, acquired through intensive language courses;
- A deep understanding of Scandinavian culture, history, and literature; 
- A developped understanding of linguistics, phonetics, morphology, syntax, etc. which are the foundation to teaching a foreign language effectively. 
- A passion to share my knowledge and promote intercultural understanding through teaching.
